{"id": "turnaj-pre-deti-v-olomouci-november-2023", "source": "archiv", "date": "2023-11-12T10:17:00", "title": "Deti: turnaj v Olomouci – november 2023", "excerpt": "Po zápase mužov sa do Olomouca vybrali aj žilinské deti.", "thumb": "assets/archive/turnaj-pre-deti-v-olomouci-november-2023/008.jpg", "category": "deti-a-mladez", "html": "<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background\" style=\"background-color:#e3ebe4;padding-top:20px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:24px\">\n<p><strong>Kedy:</strong> november 2023<br><strong>Kde:</strong> Olomouc</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>Naše deti odišli do Olomouca na pekný turnaj.</p>\n\n<p>Po zápase mužov pred pár dňami sa žilinské deti opäť vybrali do Olomouca.</p>\n\n<p>Hľadáme nové deti, príďte si zahrať rugby.</p>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Fotky</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"assets/archive/turnaj-pre-deti-v-olomouci-november-2023/001.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"assets/archive/turnaj-pre-deti-v-olomouci-november-2023/002.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"assets/archive/turnaj-pre-deti-v-olomouci-november-2023/003.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"assets/archive/turnaj-pre-deti-v-olomouci-november-2023/004.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"assets/archive/turnaj-pre-deti-v-olomouci-november-2023/005.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"assets/archive/turnaj-pre-deti-v-olomouci-november-2023/006.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"assets/archive/turnaj-pre-deti-v-olomouci-november-2023/007.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n</figure>", "link": null}